    "end": "00:00:06.950",
    "text": "Vedas are the basic scriptures of our"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:06.960",
    "end": "00:00:08.330",
    "text": "Hindu religion"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:08.340",
    "end": "00:00:11.209",
    "text": "Vedic knowledge only is revealed through"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:11.219",
    "end": "00:00:14.169",
    "text": "stories in our later epics like ramayana"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:14.179",
    "end": "00:00:16.790",
    "text": "Mahabharata and bhagavatam"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:16.800",
    "end": "00:00:19.130",
    "text": "the bhagavad-gita which is a part of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:19.140",
    "end": "00:00:21.830",
    "text": "Mahabharata has become very popular"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:21.840",
    "end": "00:00:25.609",
    "text": "because its full content is from Vedic"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:25.619",
    "end": "00:00:26.990",
    "text": "knowledge only"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:27.000",
    "end": "00:00:29.870",
    "text": "as such the Hindu religious tradition"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.880",
    "end": "00:00:32.930",
    "text": "has accorded The Vedas the highest place"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:32.940",
    "end": "00:00:36.590",
    "text": "in its literature the word Veda derived"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:36.600",
    "end": "00:00:38.990",
    "text": "from the shastri language wrote with to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:39.000",
    "end": "00:00:41.690",
    "text": "know indicate knowledge"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:41.700",
    "end": "00:00:44.389",
    "text": "there are many types of knowledges one"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.399",
    "end": "00:00:47.150",
    "text": "can gain for himself but the knowledge"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:47.160",
    "end": "00:00:50.209",
    "text": "in Veda is about the essential and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:50.219",
    "end": "00:00:51.889",
    "text": "spiritual values"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:51.899",
    "end": "00:00:55.850",
    "text": "about Dharma and Moksha that is ethical"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:55.860",
    "end": "00:00:58.010",
    "text": "or moral values of life and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.020",
    "end": "00:01:00.889",
    "text": "self-realization this analogy is"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:00.899",
