    "text": "revealed to our ancient rishis by the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:03.719",
    "end": "00:01:06.109",
    "text": "Lord himself in their spiritual vision"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:06.119",
    "end": "00:01:09.230",
    "text": "after they attained perfection in their"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:09.240",
    "end": "00:01:13.190",
    "text": "Penance and austerity as such Vedas are"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:13.200",
